OL,3,GNEWSASouthern Water fined #525k over   
OL,4,Asewage spill                           
OL,6,FSouthern Water has had a #1m penalty   
OL,7,Freduced to #525,000 on appeal after    
OL,8,Fsewage spilled into the sea when an    
OL,9,Funderground sewer pipe burst in Kent.  
OL,11,FThe incident happened in Fairfax Drive,
OL,12,FHerne Bay, on 23 March 2024, when      
OL,13,Fsewage flowed along residential streets
OL,14,Fbefore entering surface drains. The    
OL,15,Feffluence travelled through a stream   
OL,16,Fbefore entering the sea, sparking a    
OL,17,Fwarning to the public not to enter the 
OL,18,Fwater, the Environment Agency (EA)     
OL,19,Fsaid.                                  
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
