OL,3,GNEWSASouthern Water fined #525k over   
OL,4,Asewage spill                           
OL,6,FRather than pursuing a prosecution     
OL,7,Fthrough the courts, the EA imposed a   
OL,8,F#1m penalty on 16 December 2025 which  
OL,9,Fwas reduced after an appeal by Southern
OL,10,FWater on Tuesday.                      
OL,12,FSouthern Water has been approached for 
OL,13,Fcomment.                               
